 have started attacking civilians. The government has assigned their latest and most advanced Android to take out the older models. \n\nBattle your way through unique levels to take down as many robots as possible. Each level provides a unique setting with its own unique sound track. Choose from a variety of weapons before starting each level that best suits your abilities. Can you make it to the end of the level with the top score? \n", "short_description": "Androids were created to obey and make people's lives easier but a glitch in the software changed all that. Older model Androids have gone rogue and have started attacking civilians. The government has assigned their latest and most advanced Android to take out the older models. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.aftersunsetgames.com/Home/PrivacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "After Sunset Games, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://aftersunsetgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8114278578662120"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031546_1525376631560856_8062810823943287846_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QDWbXK-_ZjIQ7kNvwENsz_R&_nc_oc=AdosOiurxNvRCDSpgAsIv-GCk7JsVT8yr0ShoMt